  "blockers": [
    "Current runtime_shadow.rs deliberately returns MissingFinalUseAuthorization for non-test legacy tick. Incoming signed route is not an equivalent byte-preserving history merge.",
    "Current microbatch API uses codex_hepta_neuron frozen plan/reference backend and current metrics types. Incoming adds an incompatible earlier custom-backend/signed API under the same module and exported type names.",
    "Default merge adds previously absent workflow and legacy qualification binary and changes product method signatures/dependencies; resolving conflicts by choosing source would discard incoming feature semantics without proof.",
    "CALLERS and independent B4 history contains expansion, revert, and re-expansion. Keep existing closed-set and default-deny semantics; no authority/rules weakening was applied.",
    "Native compile/test and migrated metrics-format compatibility need substantive design work before this batch can merge; this audit does not establish a missing external user approval gate."
  ],
